{"3575360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vill", "steam_appid": 3575360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5084390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Munu is washed ashore a strange island. After meeting Trokar he learns the Island has been infected by a strange root. The root has turned the inhabitants into monsters! Will Munu free the island from its occupation and solve the mysterious rune puzzles that hold the answers to his questions?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo indie dev and looking for playtesters! If you play the demo please give me feedback in discord or anywhere else to help shape the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island is unique, as it is procedurally generated. So each playthrough will be different</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the story on harder difficulties for a challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight multiple unique enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of different weapons of the enemies you defeated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire obelisks and use them to unlock new skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genres:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Munu is washed ashore a strange island. After meeting Trokar he learns the Island has been infected by a strange root. The root has turned the inhabitants into monsters! Will Munu free the island 